      "seoTitle": "6 Consistent Face AI Portrait Prompts for Women",
      "seoDescription": "Use 6 consistent face AI portrait prompts for women, plus a practical prompt to keep the face same across poses and troubleshoot identity drift.",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.aqprompts.com/blog/consistent-face-ai-portrait-prompts-women-girls-2026",
