      "seoDescription": "Copy 5 elegant female AI portrait prompts with selfie, window-light, over-shoulder, beauty, and mirror poses, plus customization and troubleshooting.",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.aqprompts.com/blog/elegant-female-ai-portrait-prompts",
