      "seoTitle": "6 Luxury Businessman AI Portrait Prompts",
      "seoDescription": "Explore 6 luxury businessman AI portrait prompts for fictional CEO and billionaire-style concepts using hotels, city views, vehicles, and executive offices.",
      "canonicalUrl": "https://www.aqprompts.com/blog/luxury-businessman-ai-portrait-prompts",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-14",
      "keywords": "luxury businessman AI portrait prompts, luxury businessman prompts, billionaire portrait prompts, CEO portrait prompts, luxury lifestyle imagery",
      "contentType": "blog",
